{
  "version": 3,
  "comment": "Common Crawl prospect taxonomy v3. Discovery clauses and HTML signals are curated from measured yield in prospects.db (25-30 July 2026 run) and from engine-specific URL tokens in our GSA verified/success bases. Broad terms with a measured yield under 15% were removed; the fetch-time yield gate (--pattern-min-yield) keeps guarding the rest.",
  "sources": [
    "MizziDiz/cc-links-scoring known-positive URL corpus",
    "MizziDiz/Aparser-checker keygen footprint families",
    "Owner-provided GSA engine definitions (curated signatures only)",
    "prospects.db pattern yield and URL-token precision, 2026-09-05",
    "gsabases.db engine-specific URL tokens (verified + success), 2026-09-05"
  ],
